      en: 'St. Gallen rewards a slow visit more than a checklist, and a handful of named places carry most of a stay’s shape. These are the ones we would plan a day around, drawn from the City of St. Gallen, Switzerland Tourism and the Textile Museum, and checked on their own pages.',
